    "detailed_description": "Awake the droid's consciousness.<br><br>Challenge the puzzles against the system that wants to stop you from gaining control.<br><br>Activate levels of awareness by fighting the timer!<br><br>\u2605 Evocative graphics inspired by the avant-garde of cyberpunk<br>\u2605 Amazing techno soundtrack!<br>\u2605 Challenge you reasoning and speed reaction<br>\u2605 Inspired by an Amiga cult game!<br>\u2605 A different and unforgettable experience!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"style=width:100px;\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" /></div>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/bridge.gif<br><br>A fast puzzle game in which you need to activate different types of electrical circuits to direct the energy flow from the source to the droid's neural chip.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054200/extras/05afdca3d196ec96869518769fda8a8a.poster.avif?t=1662028561\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054200/extras/05afdca3d196ec96869518769fda8a8a.webm?t=1662028561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054200/extras/05afdca3d196ec96869518769fda8a8a.mp4?t=1662028561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Circuits can be deactivated by contrary electrical impulses that you will have to divert or destroy.<br><br>Reaction speed is a key aspect of the game, propelling you into a race against time following the rhythm of the wonderful cyberpunk soundtrack.<br><br>20 adrenalinic levels + 1 unlockable secret level + 2 additional levels exclusive to Steam!",
    "about_the_game": "Awake the droid's consciousness.<br><br>Challenge the puzzles against the system that wants to stop you from gaining control.<br><br>Activate levels of awareness by fighting the timer!<br><br>\u2605 Evocative graphics inspired by the avant-garde of cyberpunk<br>\u2605 Amazing techno soundtrack!<br>\u2605 Challenge you reasoning and speed reaction<br>\u2605 Inspired by an Amiga cult game!<br>\u2605 A different and unforgettable experience!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"style=width:100px;\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" /></div>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/bridge.gif<br><br>A fast puzzle game in which you need to activate different types of electrical circuits to direct the energy flow from the source to the droid's neural chip.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054200/extras/05afdca3d196ec96869518769fda8a8a.poster.avif?t=1662028561\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054200/extras/05afdca3d196ec96869518769fda8a8a.webm?t=1662028561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054200/extras/05afdca3d196ec96869518769fda8a8a.mp4?t=1662028561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Circuits can be deactivated by contrary electrical impulses that you will have to divert or destroy.<br><br>Reaction speed is a key aspect of the game, propelling you into a race against time following the rhythm of the wonderful cyberpunk soundtrack.<br><br>20 adrenalinic levels + 1 unlockable secret level + 2 additional levels exclusive to Steam!",
